    "content": "<article>    <h2>Scaled Dot-Product Attention</h2>  <p>We call the attention function on a set of queries simultaneously.</p>  <math data-latex=\"\\mathrm{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\frac{QK^{T}}{\\sqrt{d_{k}}})V\" display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"> <semantics> <mrow><mi>Attention</mi> <mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>)</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mi>softmax</mi> <mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi> <msup><mi>K</mi> <mi>T</mi></msup></mrow> <msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi> <mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo> <mi>V</mi></mrow> <annotation>\\mathrm{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\frac{QK^{T}}{\\sqrt{d_{k}}})V</annotation> </semantics> </math>  <p>The two most commonly used attention functions are additive attention and dot-product attention.</p>  <math data-latex=\"\\mathrm{MultiHead}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{Concat}(\\mathrm{head}_{1},...,\\mathrm{head}_{h})W^{O}\" display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"> <semantics> <mrow><mi>MultiHead</mi> <mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>)</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mi>Concat</mi> <mo>(</mo><msub><mi>head</mi> <mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>...</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>head</mi> <mi>h</mi></msub><mo>)</mo> <msup><mi>W</mi> <mi>O</mi></msup></mrow> <annotation>\\mathrm{MultiHead}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{Concat}(\\mathrm{head}_{1},...,\\mathrm{head}_{h})W^{O}</annotation> </semantics> </math>    </article>",
    "contentMarkdown": "## Scaled Dot-Product Attention\n\nWe call the attention function on a set of queries simultaneously.\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\frac{QK^{T}}{\\sqrt{d_{k}}})V\n$$\n\nThe two most commonly used attention functions are additive attention and dot-product attention.\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{MultiHead}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{Concat}(\\mathrm{head}_{1},...,\\mathrm{head}_{h})W^{O}\n$$",
